fixture bell_stun_takes_the_swing_control
doc Control for bell_stun_takes_the_swing: with no Bell the hit on frame 42 comes after the swing's cue, so the swing lands on frame 53 as it promised (docs/adr/0013) and costs a heart. Ash holds right from frame 43: the side 1 recoil (docs/adr/0013, 8 u from the first free tick after the hitstop) would otherwise carry Ash out of the swing's reach.
room test/dummy_swing
frames 60
input
  40 attack
  43..59 R
end
expect
  at 42 event.hit=1 event.proc=0 enemy.state=telegraph
  at 53 event.player_hit=1 hearts=4
end
